  {"term_id": "Munqathi'", "def_en": "A hadith with an interrupted chain where a narrator is missing at one or more places.", "id": "munqati", "term_en": "Munqati'", "def_id": "Hadits yang sanadnya terputus, dimana ada satu atau lebih perawi yang hilang di tengah sanad."},
